{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维与演进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observability-debugging","title":"可观测性与故障排查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/operations/observability-debugging","wordCount":1373,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"versioning-deprecation","title":"版本管理与废弃策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/operations/versioning-deprecation","wordCount":1460,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"webhook-to-event-streaming","title":"从 Webhook 到事件流的演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/operations/webhook-to-event-streaming","wordCount":1773,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"运维与演进\">运维与演进</h1><p>Webhook 系统上线后，真正的挑战才开始。投递失败的根因定位、payload 格式变更时的多版本共存、以及随着业务规模增长从点对点 webhook 向事件流架构迁移——这些都是运营阶段必须面对的课题。</p>\n<p>本章覆盖可观测性建设、版本废弃策略、以及 webhook 向 EventBridge/Eventarc 等云原生事件总线演进的路径规划。</p>\n"}